---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Gutter Problems Wake Forest NC | Clogged & Sagging Gutters" description="Clogged, sagging, or detached gutters in Wake Forest dump water against your foundation. We repair and clean. Call (919) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Gutter Problems</div>
      <h1>Gutter Problems</h1>
      <p>Gutters that overflow or pull away from the fascia send water where it can damage siding, foundation, and landscaping.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>We clear debris, reseal seams, reattach hangers, and repair or replace damaged sections so water is directed safely away from your home.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
